}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/b9abce1d-716d-4275-a384-12d900c10cfc


### Create OrgMember
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/org_members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgId": "bc2edd1b-ad72-47fd-8b49-39640eb64ddd",
  "userId": "a7f372e2-6bd2-4a26-bac0-62ed64edd623",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

